Updated mkt carriers AEJEA bottom rate

HMM:600/1000/1000  11.23VVD
YML: 575/950/950  11.23 VVD
PIL: 600/1000/1000 11.23 VVD
CSCL:600/950/950 11.24 VVD
WHL:550/900/900 11.23 VVD

As rate keep sharply downtrend for vvds in late week 47,  many cargo volume ran off which make bad pmfc on 20th Nov PSG.  In this situation, We request follow the market and adjust our rate as below on 27th Nov PSG


AEJEA
rate 600/1000/1000





